    "details": "<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Welcome to P.A.C.E - Where Logic Meets Expression. - by Coding Club TIT!</strong></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">An engaging online hackathon focused on Quizzes &amp; Treasure Hunt.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Mandatory Next Steps:</strong> To stay updated on announcements, hints, and round results, all participants must join our official communication channels:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">WhatsApp Group:</strong> <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/JEUpsgMTsNe9ZgqTy4GbD5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwix-KiLtbaWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQvwU\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/JEUpsgMTsNe9ZgqTy4GbD5</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Discord Server:</strong> <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nk9WBzsHf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwix-KiLtbaWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwAU\">https://discord.gg/Nk9WBzsHf</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">About the Opportunity:</strong></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">P.A.C.E - Where Logic Meets Expression.</strong> is an exciting online coding challenge hosted by the Coding Club TIT. Designed for individuals who thrive on problem-solving, this event invites participants to showcase their technical prowess and analytical capabilities in a competitive environment.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Participants will have the opportunity to demonstrate a diverse set of skills, including logical reasoning, data structures and algorithms, and critical thinking. By engaging in this challenge, you will put your technical expertise to the test and sharpen your ability to navigate complex problems under pressure.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competition Structure:</strong></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">The structure for this coding challenge is as follows:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">The Kernel Check (Online):</strong> In this initial round, you will complete a structured online assessment featuring multiple-choice questions designed to evaluate your core technical knowledge and analytical thinking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\">&lt;/&gt; <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Code Contest (Offline):</strong> Shortlisted candidates will advance to this stage to tackle a series of Data Structures and Algorithms (DSA) problems.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\">️ <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"4\">Interview:</strong> In this final offline round, shortlisted candidates will face a real interview conducted by a panel to demonstrate their skills and thought processes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Prepare to put your skills to the test and join the Coding Club TIT for this unique challenge&mdash;register now to participate in P.A.C.E - Where Logic Meets Expression.</p>",
